<view wx:if="{{isMock}}" class="demo">内测演示 · 数据仅保存在本机</view>
<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">OR ADV / JOIN</view><view class="title">{{member.memberKind === 'founder' ? '参加本场活动' : '报名意向'}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在核对本场规则…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="retry">重新读取最新规则</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{success}}" class="card mt"><text class="tag {{result.state === 'confirmed' ? 'tag-dark' : ''}}">{{result.state === 'confirmed' ? '已确认参加' : '申请已提交'}}</text><view class="card-title mt">{{success}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{successMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{feeHint}}" class="notice">线下具体安排由工作人员说明，以「已确认参加」状态为准。</view><view wx:if="{{feeHint && contact.configured}}" class="small muted mt">{{contact.contactName}} · {{contact.contactValue}}</view><button wx:if="{{feeHint && contact.configured}}" class="secondary full mt" bindtap="contact">{{contact.contactMethod === 'phone' ? '联系工作人员' : '复制联系信息'}}</button><button class="primary full mt" bindtap="mine">{{result.state === 'confirmed' ? '查看行前安排' : '查看本场进展'}}</button></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{activity}}">
    <view class="card mt"><view class="card-title">{{activity.title}}</view><view class="small muted mt">{{activity.dateText}} · {{activity.location}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row small"><text>成长门槛</text><text>{{activity.minGrowthPoints}} 分</text></view><view class="row small mt"><text>本场规则</text><text>v{{activity.ruleVersion}}</text></view></view>
    <block wx:if="{{!member}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">建立车友身份</text><text class="section-index">01 / HELLO</text></view><view class="small muted paragraph">同意后，通过微信专属标识关联你的报名与成长。新用户从零积分开始，昵称可不填，无需手机、头像或定位权限。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">昵称（选填，最多 24 字）</text><input maxlength="24" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="nickname" placeholder="希望大家怎样称呼你"/></view><checkbox-group bindchange="identityConsent"><label class="check-line"><checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{identityConsent}}" color="#31543e"/><text>我已阅读身份与隐私说明，同意为报名、核验与成长记录建立身份，确认自己具备适合本场活动的参与条件。</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="text-button" bindtap="privacy">阅读隐私与使用说明 →</button></block>
    <view wx:else class="notice"><view>以「{{member.nickname}}」参加 · {{kindLabel}}</view><view class="mt">{{member.memberKind === 'founder' ? '规则、资格与名额满足时，直接确认参加；不跳过技能和现场核验。' : '先提交申请，资格与名额核对通过后，按本场提示联系工作人员，由管理员确认参加。'}}</view></view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本场须知</text><text class="section-index">02 / AGREEMENT</text></view><view class="small paragraph">{{activity.safetyNotice}}</view><view class="small muted paragraph mt">必要装备：{{activity.equipment}}</view>
    <view class="notice">名额不足时进入候补，不占名额。候补或资格尚未通过时，无需提前安排缴费。食宿交通自理，服务条款与线下安排由组织方真实告知。</view>
    <checkbox-group bindchange="ruleConsent"><label class="check-line"><checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{ruleConsent}}" color="#31543e"/><text>我已阅读活动详情、技能装备要求与风险说明，接受规则 v{{activity.ruleVersion}}，理解报名、出发核验、结束核验与完成结算分别记录。</text></label></checkbox-group>
    <button class="primary full" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || !ruleConsent || (!member && !identityConsent) || !activity.canApply}}" bindtap="submit">{{activity.slots > 0 ? (member.memberKind === 'founder' ? '同意规则并参加' : '确认提交报名意向') : '确认提交候补意向'}}</button>
    <view class="footer-note">重复提交不会重复占位。<text>{{'\n'}}</text>网络中断后可先查看本场进展，再决定是否重试。</view>
  </block>
</view>
